Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ==============================================================================
; Neumorphic Dark Soft UI - System-Wide Palette & DWM Configuration Patch
; Author: Principal Systems Software Engineer & OS Theming Architect
; Architecture: Windows 10 (1903+) / Windows 11 (21H2, 22H2, 23H2, 24H2)
; ==============================================================================

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 1. Global User Palette & Classic Win32 System Colors
; Base Surface: #18191C (24 25 28)
; Elevated Controls: #1E2024 (30 32 36)
; Inset / Sunken: #141517 (20 21 23)
; Specular Highlight: #2A2C32 (42 44 50)
; Occlusion Shadow: #0D0E10 (13 14 16)
; Accent: #38BDF8 (56 189 248)
; Text: #E2E8F0 (226 232 240)
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
